description:
Remove the local Google credential and stop collection. Keep the last good sample. The last good sample stays available. An in-flight callback or collection cannot reconnect the site. Returns: { available, connected, property, last_attempt_at, last_success_at, next_run_at, error, stale, snapshot{property,period,checked_at,queries,pages,coverage}, opportunities[{query,clicks,impressions,ctr,position}], terms[{query,last_alert_at,analysis,series}] }
Example: await fetch("$ORIGIN/api/sites/SITE_ID/search-console", {method:"DELETE", headers:{"X-CSRF-Token":csrf}}).then(r => r.json());
Errors: 401: account_required or session_ended; 403: account_required or invalid_csrf; 404: site_not_found; 503: sites_unavailable
